{"page":4,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:17","surah":2,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"مَثَلُهُمْ كَمَثَلِ ٱلَّذِى ٱسْتَوْقَدَ نَارًا فَلَمَّآ أَضَآءَتْ مَا حَوْلَهُۥ ذَهَبَ ٱللَّهُ بِنُورِهِمْ وَتَرَكَهُمْ فِى ظُلُمَـٰتٍ لَّا يُبْصِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They are like people who [labour to] kindle a fire: when it lights up everything around them, God takes away all their light, leaving them in utter darkness, unable to see-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَثَلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"Their example","transliteration":"mathaluhum","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَمَثَلِ","en_gloss":"(is) like (the) example","transliteration":"kamathali","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) the one who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱسْتَوْقَدَ","en_gloss":"kindled","transliteration":"is'tawqada","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَارًۭا","en_gloss":"a fire","transliteration":"nāran","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَمَّآ","en_gloss":"then, when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَضَآءَتْ","en_gloss":"it illuminated","transliteration":"aḍāat","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَوْلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"(was) around him","transliteration":"ḥawlahu","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذَهَبَ","en_gloss":"took away","transliteration":"dhahaba","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِنُورِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their light","transliteration":"binūrihim","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَتَرَكَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and left them","transliteration":"watarakahum","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ظُلُمَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"darkness[es]","transliteration":"ẓulumātin","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(so) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يُبْصِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(do) they see","transliteration":"yub'ṣirūna","verse_key":"2:17"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:17"}]},{"verse_key":"2:18","surah":2,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"صُمٌّۢ بُكْمٌ عُمْىٌ فَهُمْ لَا يَرْجِعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"deaf, dumb, and blind: they will never return.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"صُمٌّۢ","en_gloss":"Deaf","transliteration":"ṣummun","verse_key":"2:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بُكْمٌ","en_gloss":"dumb","transliteration":"buk'mun","verse_key":"2:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عُمْىٌۭ","en_gloss":"blind","transliteration":"ʿum'yun","verse_key":"2:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"2:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَرْجِعُونَ","en_gloss":"[they] will not return","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","verse_key":"2:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:18"}]},{"verse_key":"2:19","surah":2,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"أَوْ كَصَيِّبٍ مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ فِيهِ ظُلُمَـٰتٌ وَرَعْدٌ وَبَرْقٌ يَجْعَلُونَ أَصَـٰبِعَهُمْ فِىٓ ءَاذَانِهِم مِّنَ ٱلصَّوَٰعِقِ حَذَرَ ٱلْمَوْتِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ مُحِيطٌۢ بِٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Or [like people who, under] a cloudburst from the sky, with its darkness, thunder, and lightning, put their fingers into their ears to keep out the thunderclaps for fear of death- God surrounds the disbelievers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَصَيِّبٍۢ","en_gloss":"like a rainstorm","transliteration":"kaṣayyibin","verse_key":"2:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"2:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it (are)","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ظُلُمَـٰتٌۭ","en_glos