","verse_key":"2:21"}]},{"verse_key":"2:22","surah":2,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى جَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلْأَرْضَ فِرَٰشًا وَٱلسَّمَآءَ بِنَآءً وَأَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَأَخْرَجَ بِهِۦ مِنَ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ رِزْقًا لَّكُمْ ۖ فَلَا تَجْعَلُوا۟ لِلَّهِ أَندَادًا وَأَنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"who spread out the earth for you and built the sky; who sent water down from it and with that water produced things for your sustenance. Do not, knowing this, set up rivals to God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"The One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakumu","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِرَٰشًۭا","en_gloss":"a resting place","transliteration":"firāshan","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءَ","en_gloss":"and the sky","transliteration":"wal-samāa","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِنَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"a canopy","transliteration":"bināan","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"and sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzala","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَأَخْرَجَ","en_gloss":"then brought forth","transliteration":"fa-akhraja","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"therewith","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the fruits","transliteration":"l-thamarāti","verse_key":"2:22"},{"pos":16,"ar":"رِزْقًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) provis